abstract: >-
  Research prototype that evaluates MESA Invariant 1 (directed inbound trifecta
  closure Cl(b)) over a typed agent/service interaction graph. Not for production
  policy enforcement. Companion ACM JSON Schema included.
keywords:
  - agentic-security
  - multi-agent
  - least-agency
  - interaction-boundary
  - ensemble-trifecta
  - MESA
